{"id":"saatchi-root","ord":"a0","title":"saatchi — photograph an app doing the thing","desc":"The project folder for github.com/juspay/saatchi (local clone ~/code/saatchi): a standalone, app-neutral tool that runs a playwright section against a running app and produces screenshot/video evidence. Born from olai's lanes rebuilding evidence plumbing per-PR; the design is brainstorming/evidence-driver.md at this vault's root, settled with the human 2026-08-28.","created":"2026-08-28T14:56:26-04:00"}
{"id":"saatchi-v1","parent":"saatchi-root","ord":"a0","title":"saatchi v1: the tool, the scaffold, and the example that is its CI","done":"2026-08-28T16:05:57-04:00","desc":"Build the repo per brainstorming/evidence-driver.md (the whole spec): the nix run app, saatchi.sh + lib/, the first-run scaffold, example/ as a complete in-repo consumer doubling as CI, README near-verbatim from the spec. DRAFT PR, human-merge. Paired with the olai consumer lane (olai-saatchi in olai/roadmap/infra.olai): olai runs this branch via nix run path:, findings flow both ways through the orchestrator — the provider-consumer arrangement proved on #405/kolu#2219.","created":"2026-08-28T14:56:26-04:00","changed":"2026-08-28T16:05:59-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","brief":"briefs/saatchi-build.md","dispatched":"2026-08-28T15:05:00-04:00","merge":"merge-human","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/saatchi/commit/e527f597","merged":"2026-08-28T16:07:00-04:00","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/saatchi/pull/1","terminal":"16ee6817","tier":"ordinary","worktree":".worktrees/build"}}
